(text "Route IN+ / IN- as Kelvin pairs directly to the shunt pads. VBUS senses the load side.\nA0 = A1 = GND. ALERT is unused. One monitor measures the combined heater current.\n2 mOhm: 2.5 uV/LSB = 1.25 mA/LSB. ADC full scale is not the board current rating." (at 25.4000 152.4000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1a1f4ffe-7987-5c5b-9ff9-699d09fa2f9f"))
